  <prompt>Rebuild + redeploy VisualHost (which bundles the lazy-loaded Invoice/KPI wizard chunks), then smoke-test the "+" flow for all three wizards end-to-end.</prompt>
  <role>SPAARKE PCF developer. Follow pcf-deploy (build:prod, shared-lib installed first).</role>
  <goal>Deployed VisualHost with working "+" → Event/Invoice/KPI wizards; each creates a valid record regarding the host; documents dual-bind (Event/Invoice); no regression to spaarkle/open; bundle delta &lt; 5 KB.</goal>

  <context>
    <background>Wizards are React.lazy chunks in the shared lib consumed by VisualHost — redeploy VisualHost to ship them. Verify no BFF files in the diff (NFR-02).</background>
    <relevant-files>src/client/pcf/VisualHost/</relevant-files>
  </context>

  <knowledge>
    <files>
      docs/guides/PCF-DEPLOYMENT-GUIDE.md
      .claude/skills/pcf-deploy/SKILL.md
      projects/visual-host-create-button-r1/spec.md
      .claude/skills/ui-test/SKILL.md
    </files>
  </knowledge>

  <steps>
    <step>Install shared-lib node_modules; bump VisualHost version; build:prod; copy artifacts; pack.ps1; provide ZIP path (or import).</step>
    <step>git diff --stat — confirm NO src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api files (BFF=N).</step>
    <step>Smoke each wizard: Event (dual-bind doc), Invoice (dual-bind doc), KPI (no files); verify regarding + resolver fields; verify Next Steps cards create follow-ons regarding the child.</step>
    <step>Verify spaarkle/open unaffected; measure bundle delta.</step>
  </steps>

  <tools>Bash, PowerShell, Skill(pcf-deploy), Skill(ui-test)</tools>
  <outputs>Deployed VisualHost ZIP; smoke results for all 3 wizards.</outputs>

  <acceptance-criteria>
    <criterion>All 3 wizards open + create valid records regarding the host with resolver fields.</criterion>
    <criterion>Event/Invoice document dual-binds; KPI has no files step.</criterion>
    <criterion>Next Steps (Send Email/Add To Do/Assign Work) create follow-ons regarding the child.</criterion>
    <criterion>No BFF files in diff; bundle delta &lt; 5 KB; spaarkle/open unaffected.</criterion>
  </acceptance-criteria>
</task>
